 "meta": {

 "title": "The Archetypes - Waking up to our inner truths.",

 "description": "The 12 archetypes are a concept in psychology and mythology, which describe universal, symbolic characters or personas that exist within the collective unconscious of humanity. Each archetype can take on whatever it inspires within you, we all have these characteristics inside of us, and they are the uniting factor of our human condition. The artworks are intended to be raw and uninhibited, not just for enjoyment but to move that part inside of us.",

 "creator": "Leslie Lee - https://www.instagram.com/leslieleeart/ - https://www.artstation.com/leslielee"

